lans and  God laughs I mean you just can't  possibly plan out everything  [Music]  what are you going to do in the place  where you work in a large corporation  and a small start-up what are you going  to do personally to help other people to  balance work and family how are you  going to change policies about family  leave what are you going to do about  childcare for your employees and the  people you manage I mean one guy saying  you know I told her when she comes back  she doesn't have to have her old job  back she can be in a much easier job  with less travel and in general there's  at least one woman students at classes  and I don't want that when I come back I  want to be just treated the way I was  before I want the travel I want the  promotions and so men and women get to  see that not everybody has the same view  here some women want to come back and  you know take a slower role for a while  and some don't and the only way to know  this is to actually have a face-to-face  conversation with the employee when  she's ready to come back you know what  what is it that that you see for  yourself and the other thing they learn  is that what you say when you're  pregnant and you've never had a child  before may be different from what you  say when you have had the child  particularly if the child has a problem  of one sort or another and so again  people see that and they learn from each  other  they see what a wide variety of  experiences people have  you

